\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  39. (ff. 149v\endash 154r) In dominicam IV Lucae (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u954 \'ea\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8118 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 \u8158 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u937 \'d9\u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u952 \'e8\u8052 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u8061 ?\u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u968 \'f8\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7988 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7988 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7988 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8103 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vgl. unten, ff. 213v\endash 217r (Nr. 55) und 278r\endash 279v (\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr. 25); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ehrhard\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u220 \'dcberlieferung III, S. 584\endash 585.}

