\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  53. (ff. 206v\endash 209v) In dominicam ante lumina (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\plain \f4\lang1033\fs24 `\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u837 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (nach der Perikope Marc. 1, 1\endash 3) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8021 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u80