\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. (ff. 217v\endash 220v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes Chrysostomus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Quod ecclesia est corpus Christi* (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\u969 \'f9\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u7969 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs