\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 1r\endash 43v) In Phaed. 69e6\endash 118a17 (Komm. I) (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u8053 ?\u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ? \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Westerink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , The Greek Commentaries, II, S. 125\endash 285 (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Damascius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I, \u167 \'a7\u167 \'a7 207\endash 562); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Norvin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 132\endash 205 (= C.I.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash III.\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u240 \'f0\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Am Textende in Rot: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash (ff. 43v\endash 47r) In Phaed. 69e6\endash 77a5 (Komm. II) (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ? \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain