\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  18. (ff. 254r\endash 266r, 20. Z.) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Isaac Argyrus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Methodus rationalis solarium et lunarium cyclorum (Computus ecclesiasticus) (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u8048 ?\u954 \'ea \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u964 \'f4\u8183 ? \u927 \'cf\u7984 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u8131 ? \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u954 \'ea\u8179 ? \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2 \u945 \'e1\u7984 ?\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8048 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u7969 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u8059 ?\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), PG 19, 1280\endash 1314; (f. 257r, 18. Z.) Textauslassung: PG 19, 1289 A 1 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u9