\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  20. (ff. 272r\endash 273v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Isaac Argyrus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Methodus geodaesiae (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?? \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u8048 ?\u954 \'ea\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \u8003 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8033 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed \u928 \'d0\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u8055 ?\u8179 ?,\u964 \'f4\u8183 ? \u922 \'ca\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\u946 \'e2\u8119 ? \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u8053 ?\u957 \'ed\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8004 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7984 ?\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u96