\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  21. (ff. 284v\endash 287v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Nicolaus Rhabdas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Epistula ad Theodorum Tzabuchem (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8183 ? \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u952 \'e8\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u8179 ? \u964 \'f4\u8183 ? \u922 \'ca\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u950 \'e6\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8150 ? \u932 \'d4\u950 \'e6\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u967 \'f7\u8131 ? \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u8061 ?\u961 \'f1\u8179 ? \plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u925 \'cd\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u931 \'d3\u956 \'ec\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u7952 ?\u954 \'ea \u914 \'c2\u965 \'f5\u950 \'e6\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ? \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8190 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u929 \'d1\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u948 \'e4\u8118 ?\u962 \'f2 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9 \u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Tannery\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Notice (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 118\endash 186; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S. 126, 26 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8053 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Auf f. 287v in Rot Notiz des Schreibers bez\u252 \'fcglich des l\u252 \'fcckenhaften Textendes (vgl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).}

