\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  23. (ff. 328v, 1. Z.\endash 347r) \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Damascius Damascenus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , In Platonis Phaedonem commentarium; in Phaed. 62b2\endash 69c6 (Komm. I)\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel; Text direkt an das Vorangehende anschlie\u223 \'dfend); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u958 \'ee\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Westerink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , The Greek Commentaries, II (s. o. Nr. 1), S. 27\endash 103 (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Damascius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I, \u167 \'a7\u167 \'a7 1\endash 169); ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Norvin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 84\endash 122, 12 (= B.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u958 \'ee\u950 \'e6\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Einige kurze Textauslassungen, an diesen Stellen (ff. 328v, 329r) Zeilen ganz oder teilweise leer gelassen, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Westerink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , The Greek Commentaries, II, S. 27, 31. \endash Am Textende in Rot: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \u7970 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u7936 ?\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u968 \'f8\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

