\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 348r\endash 408r, 409r\endash 412r, 413r\endash 426r, 427r\endash 457v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Theodorus Metochites\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Compendium astronomicum; lib. I 1\endash 31, 34 (Ms. [f. 350v] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u7936 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u8061 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u967 \'f7\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u7936 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \u8103 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8053 ?\u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f0\fs24 \u7960 ?\u956 \'b5\u959 ?\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u948 \'e4\u8053 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u954 \'ea\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 \u8001 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Teileditionen: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Byd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 417\endash 474 (= lib. I, 1\endash 5); s. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 K. Sathas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bibliotheca Graeca Medii Aevi, I, Paris 1872, \plain \f7\scaps\lang1024\fs24 \u352 \'8a\plain \f7\scaps\lang1024\fs24 ev\plain \f7\scaps\lang1024\fs24 \u269 \'e8\plain \f7\scaps\lang1024\fs24 enko\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u201 \'c9tudes und B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Byd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , To Every Argument There is a Counter-Argument, in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 K. Ierodiakonou\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Hrsg.), Byzantine Philosophy and Its Ancient Sources, Oxford 2002 (die entsprechenden Seitenangaben mit der Auflistung der edierten Abschnitte in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Byd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ], S. 415). In Rot und der braunen Schreibtinte einige erkl\u228 \'e4rende Zeichnungen (ff. 393r, 395r, 397r\endash v) und astronomische Tabellen (ff. 407r\endash 408r, 412r, 427r\endash 442v, 444v, 455r). \endash (ff. 408v, 412v, 426v) leer. Auf ff. 408v, 412v die Anmerkung \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Hand a). \endash (f. 458r) Subscriptio des Kopisten (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash (f. 458v) leer. \endash Unmittelbar vor dem Compendium: (ff. 348r\endash 350r) Kapitelverzeichnis (Ms. \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u8017 ?\u968 \'f8\u951 \'e7\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u8057 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5, \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u7936 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u8061 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u967 \'f7\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u7936 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u8127 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u903 ? \u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5 \u7956 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8183 ? \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8061 ?\u964 \'f4\u8179 ? \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sathas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , I (s. oben), S. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u951 \'e7\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  In der Hs. unvollst\u228 \'e4ndiges Kapitelverzeichnis (Kapitel \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u950 \'e6\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ausgelassen). \endash Am Ende des Kapitelverzeichnisses (f. 350r) in Rot: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f2\super\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1 \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u240 \'f0\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 V\plain \f6\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash In roter Tinte die Randkapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung, sowohl im Kapitelverzeichnis als auch im Text. Zitate mit einfachen Anf\u252 \'fchrungszeichen am Rand gekennzeichnet.}

